00:24:47.390 --> 00:24:48.910
It's really not rocket science,

580
00:24:48.910 --> 00:24:50.750
and it's not just messaging.

581
00:24:50.750 --> 00:24:52.750
It's not just messaging.

582
00:24:52.750 --> 00:24:56.260
It's who they are willing to serve, at the end of the day.

583
00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:58.920
And why can't they just get that done?

584
00:24:58.920 --> 00:25:02.130
Because they, at the end of the day, are under the thrall

