and within three days,

635
00:27:06.410 --> 00:27:08.227
the talking points were so obvious:

636
00:27:08.227 --> 00:27:10.390
"She's dangerous. She's crazy."

637
00:27:10.390 --> 00:27:11.223
I (chuckles) love that one.

638
00:27:11.223 --> 00:27:12.937
We're going back to ancient times, right?

639
00:27:12.937 --> 00:27:14.790
"She's dangerous. She's crazy.

640
00:27:14.790 --> 00:27:17.120
She's kooky. She's a crystal lady.

641
00:27:17.120 --> 00:27:20.713
She's anti-vax. She's anti-science.

642
00:27:22.040 --> 00:27:24.077
She's anti-gay."

643
00:27:25.666 --> 00:27:27.483
It was the talking points.

644
00:27:30.340 --> 00:27:31.400
You couldn't open your computer.

645
00:27:31.400 --> 00:27:32.257
You couldn't turn on television

646
00:27:32.257 --> 00:27:33.840
whilst someone wasn't saying it

647
00:27:34.690 --> 00:27:36.260
and for exactly the reason you said.

648
00:27:36.260 --> 00:27:37.420
These people who did that,

649
00:27:37.420 --> 00:27:39.940
they didn't do it because they thought I was silly.

650
00:27:39.940 --> 00:27:43.470
They did it because they knew that I was serious.

651
00:27:43.470 --> 00:27:46.910
That's why they created the mischaracterizations

652
00:27:46.910 --> 00:27:49.380
and the silly-girl bullshit,

653
00:27:49.380 --> 00:27:51.092
because they knew that I was very, very-

