00:27:58.090 --> 00:28:01.120
and people are reacting and responding to that favorably,

659
00:28:01.120 --> 00:28:03.110
then you become a threat

660
00:28:03.110 --> 00:28:06.580
to the hegemony of the DNC

661
00:28:06.580 --> 00:28:08.470
and their greater agenda, right?

662
00:28:08.470 --> 00:28:09.303
Exactly.

663
00:28:10.810 --> 00:28:13.150
All we know as citizens is...

